{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f3c1a2-9d64-4e58-8c21-5a0f3d6e8c17",
    "name": "观测台 · 只读用量 HTTP 接口",
    "description": "观测台（Observatory）只读用量查询接口。\n\n## 使用方法\n\n1. 先在应用里开启「局域网共享」，并在「AI 用量 → 管理设备 → 只读用量 HTTP 接口」生成只读 API 密钥。\n2. 导入同目录的环境文件 `postman-observatory-usage.environment.json`，把 `apiKey` 换成你的密钥。\n3. 如从其他设备访问，把 `baseUrl` 改成服务器局域网 IP（例如 `http://192.168.1.20:17891`）。\n\n## 约定\n\n- 区间一律左闭右开 `[start, endExclusive)`。\n- 顶层是所选区间的合计；`daily` 与 `buckets` 是同一批数据的两种分组，三者加总一致。\n- `model` 按有效计价模型匹配，口径与页面一致（`modelFilterBasis=effectivePricingModel`）。\n- 历史只剩日汇总时，秒级区间切天会返回 422，而不是给出被截断的数字。\n\n接口说明见仓库 `docs/只读用量HTTP接口.md`，设计稿见 `docs/AI用量查询接口设计.md`。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "概览",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "今天 · Claude Code",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=1&appType=claude",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "最近一个日历日的 Claude Code 用量。`appType=claude` 只含 Claude Code，不混入 Claude Desktop。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 · 单日汇总",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "Cache-Control",
                  "value": "no-store"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": {
                "mode": "raw",
                "raw": "{\n  \"requests\": 1,\n  \"inputTokens\": 100,\n  \"outputTokens\": 20,\n  \"cacheReadTokens\": 300,\n  \"cacheWriteTokens\": 10,\n  \"totalTokens\": 430,\n  \"costUsd\": 1.25,\n  \"scope\": \"local\",\n  \"appType\": \"claude\",\n  \"apps\": [\"claude\"],\n  \"model\": null,\n  \"modelFilterBasis\": \"effectivePricingModel\",\n  \"days\": 1,\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2026-11-01\",\n  \"range\": {\n    \"start\": \"2026-11-01T00:00:00+08:00\",\n    \"endExclusive\": \"2026-11-02T00:00:00+08:00\",\n    \"timezone\": \"server-local\"\n  },\n  \"groupBy\": \"day\",\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"inputTokenSemantics\": \"fresh\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-11-01T13:42:11Z\",\n  \"lastScanAt\": null,\n  \"buckets\": [\n    {\n      \"requests\": 1,\n      \"inputTokens\": 100,\n      \"outputTokens\": 20,\n      \"cacheReadTokens\": 300,\n      \"cacheWriteTokens\": 10,\n      \"totalTokens\": 430,\n      \"costUsd\": 1.25,\n      \"period\": \"2026-11-01\",\n      \"start\": \"2026-11-01T00:00:00+08:00\",\n      \"endExclusive\": \"2026-11-02T00:00:00+08:00\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"daily\": [\n    {\n      \"requests\": 1,\n      \"inputTokens\": 100,\n      \"outputTokens\": 20,\n      \"cacheReadTokens\": 300,\n      \"cacheWriteTokens\": 10,\n      \"totalTokens\": 430,\n      \"costUsd\": 1.25,\n      \"date\": \"2026-11-01\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
              },
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "最近 7 天 · 全部应用",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "不填 `appType` 时合计所有**允许共享**的应用；未勾选共享的应用不会出现在结果里。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "最近 30 天 · 按天分组",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=30&groupBy=day",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "30"
                },
                {
                  "key": "groupBy",
                  "value": "day",
                  "description": "day | week | month"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`groupBy` 只改变 `buckets`，不改变顶层合计和 `daily`。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "时间区间",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "指定日期区间 · 按周分组",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&appType=claude&groupBy=week",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "startDate",
                  "value": "{{startDate}}",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD，包含该日"
                },
                {
                  "key": "endDate",
                  "value": "{{endDate}}",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD，包含该日，不得晚于服务器今天"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "groupBy",
                  "value": "week"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "两端日期都包含。ISO 周编号用该周所属年份，跨年周不会拼错日历年（例如 `2026-W01` 可能起始于 2025-12-29）。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "指定日期区间 · 按月分组",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&groupBy=month",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "startDate",
                  "value": "{{startDate}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "endDate",
                  "value": "{{endDate}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "groupBy",
                  "value": "month"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "月分组的 `period` 形如 `2026-11`；首尾 bucket 是自然周期与查询区间的交集，空周期补零。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "秒级区间",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?startTime={{startTime}}&endTime={{endTime}}&appType=claude&groupBy=day",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "startTime",
                  "value": "{{startTime}}",
                  "description": "RFC 3339，必须带 UTC 偏移，精确到整秒，包含"
                },
                {
                  "key": "endTime",
                  "value": "{{endTime}}",
                  "description": "RFC 3339，不包含"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "groupBy",
                  "value": "day"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`startTime` 与 `endTime` 必须成对提供，且不能与 `days`/`startDate`/`endDate` 混用。\n\n注意：URL 里的 `+` 必须编码为 `%2B`。Postman 会自动编码，但复制到别处时要注意。\n\n若该区间把某一天切成两半，而那天只剩日汇总（日粒度），接口返回 422 而不是给出被截断的数字。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "秒级区间 · 完整一天",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?startTime={{dayStart}}&endTime={{dayEnd}}&appType=claude",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "startTime",
                  "value": "{{dayStart}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "endTime",
                  "value": "{{dayEnd}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "完整覆盖一个自然日时，日汇总可以整日计入，不会触发 422。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "筛选",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "按模型筛选",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7&appType=claude&model={{model}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "model",
                  "value": "{{model}}",
                  "description": "有效计价模型 ID，精确匹配"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "匹配口径 `COALESCE(NULLIF(pricing_model,''), model)`，与页面模型筛选一致。\n\n格式合法但没有匹配记录时返回 200 和零值，不是错误。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "区间 + 模型 + 周分组",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&appType=claude&model={{model}}&groupBy=week",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "startDate",
                  "value": "{{startDate}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "endDate",
                  "value": "{{endDate}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "model",
                  "value": "{{model}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "groupBy",
                  "value": "week"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "筛选先作用于基础记录，再在所有层级聚合；顶层、`daily`、`buckets` 三者加总一致。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Claude Desktop（与 Claude Code 分开）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7&appType=claude-desktop",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                },
                {
                  "key": "appType",
                  "value": "claude-desktop"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`appType=claude` 仅指 Claude Code，`claude-desktop` 单独查询。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "错误场景",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "400 · days 越界",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=999",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "999"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`days` 合法范围是 1–366。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 · INVALID_PARAMETERS",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": {
                "mode": "raw",
                "raw": "{\n  \"error\": \"days 必须为 1–366\",\n  \"code\": \"INVALID_PARAMETERS\"\n}"
              },
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "400 · 未知参数",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7&unknown=1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                },
                {
                  "key": "unknown",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "未知参数直接被拒绝。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 · INVALID_PARAMETERS",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": {
                "mode": "raw",
                "raw": "{\n  \"error\": \"查询参数无效\",\n  \"code\": \"INVALID_PARAMETERS\"\n}"
              },
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "400 · 重复参数",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7&days=8",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                },
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "8"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "重复参数在解析前就被拒绝（JSON 反序列化只会保留最后一个值）。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 · INVALID_PARAMETERS",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": {
                "mode": "raw",
                "raw": "{\n  \"error\": \"参数重复: days\",\n  \"code\": \"INVALID_PARAMETERS\"\n}"
              },
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "400 · 不支持的 groupBy",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7&groupBy=year",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                },
                {
                  "key": "groupBy",
                  "value": "year"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "只支持 `day`、`week`、`month`。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 · UNSUPPORTED_GROUP_BY",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": {
                "mode": "raw",
                "raw": "{\n  \"error\": \"不支持的 groupBy: year\",\n  \"code\": \"UNSUPPORTED_GROUP_BY\"\n}"
              },
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "400 · 时间模式冲突",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usage/summary?days=7&startDate={{startDate}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "usage",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "days",
                  "value": "7"
                },
                {
                  "key": "startDate",
                  "value": "{{startDate}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`days` 与 `startDate` 不能同时使用；秒级区间也不能与它们混用。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 · CONFLICTING_TIME_PARAMETERS",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": {
                "mode": "raw",
                "raw": "{\n  \"error\": \"startDate 不能与 days 同时使用\",\n  \"code\": \"CONFLICTING_TIME_PARAMETERS\"\n}"
              },
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
